cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HIDE-deconv, please cite the preprint listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "HIDE-deconv: Hierarchical cell-type deconvolution and analysis of bulk RNA-seq data using single-cell references"
abstract: >-
  HIDE-deconv is a Python package and command line interface for hierarchical
  cell-type deconvolution of bulk RNA-seq data using annotated single-cell
  references. It jointly estimates cellular compositions across multiple
  levels of a cell-type hierarchy and integrates reference construction,
  model training, deconvolution, statistical analysis and visualization.
